title: "Testing the Fluorescence Advantage: Does Solar-Induced Fluorescence Signal Agricultural Drought Earlier than NDVI in Marathwada, India?"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Maske"
    given-names: "Sakshi D."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-5683-5966"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sakshimaske303-commits/GREEN_ALIBI"
